---
// Testimonials section with orbit animation, tweet ticker, and booking container
---

<section class="testimonials" id="testimonials">
  <div class="testi-head">
    <span class="tag">
      <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/badge-why.png" alt="" width="14" height="14">
      Verified Reviews
    </span>
    <h2 class="testi-big">
      <span class="tb-line"><em>Smart founders</em> <span class="tb-gray">send</span></span>
      <span class="tb-line">
        <span class="tb-gray">us their</span>
        <span class="tb-ico"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/assets/appstore-icon.svg" alt="App Store"></span>
        <em>apps</em> <span class="tb-gray">to</span>
      </span>
      <span class="tb-line type-line">
        <span id="testi-type"></span>
        <span class="type-cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </span>
    </h2>
  </div>

  <div class="testi-phone">
    <div class="testi-notch"></div>
    <div class="testi-screen">
      <div class="testi-orbit">
        <span class="t-ring t-ring-1"></span>
        <span class="t-ring t-ring-2"></span>
        <div class="t-orbit-spin">
          <img class="t-av" style="--ta:305deg" src="/assets/avatars/a96-12.jpg" alt="Founder avatar 1" loading="lazy">
          <img class="t-av" style="--ta:55deg"  src="/assets/avatars/a96-32.jpg" alt="Founder avatar 2" loading="lazy">
          <img class="t-av" style="--ta:170deg" src="/assets/avatars/a96-47.jpg" alt="Founder avatar 3" loading="lazy">
          <img class="t-av inner" style="--ta:230deg" src="/assets/avatars/a96-26.jpg" alt="Founder avatar 4" loading="lazy">
          <img class="t-av inner" style="--ta:20deg"  src="/assets/avatars/a96-59.jpg" alt="Founder avatar 5" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <h3>Happy founders,<br>prettier apps</h3>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tweet-ticker-wrap">
    <div class="ticker" id="tweet-ticker" data-speed="45" data-arc="3200">
      <div class="ticker-track">
        <article class="tweet">
          <div class="tweet-head">
            <img src="/assets/avatars/tw-EndrewBiz.jpg" alt="Endrew Cruz" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <div class="tweet-who"><strong>Endrew Cruz</strong><span>@EndrewBiz · <a>Follow</a></span></div>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="x-logo"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="tweet-text">Deslopify took our messy MVP and turned it into an investor-ready beast. Raised our Series A 3 weeks after shipping!</p>
          <div class="tweet-foot">
            <span class="t-like"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21s-7.5-4.9-9.8-9.2C.6 8.6 2.6 5 6 5c2 0 3.4 1.1 4 2.2C10.6 6.1 12 5 14 5c3.4 0 5.4 3.6 3.8 6.8C19.5 16.1 12 21 12 21z"/></svg></span>
            <span class="t-reply">Reply</span>
            <span class="t-copy">Copy link</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="tweet">
          <div class="tweet-head">
            <img src="/assets/avatars/tw-LottieFiles.jpg" alt="LottieFiles" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <div class="tweet-who"><strong>LottieFiles</strong><span>@LottieFiles · <a>Follow</a></span></div>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="x-logo"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="tweet-text">Looks awesome! Clean code, zero template bloat, and fluid 60fps animations throughout.</p>
          <div class="tweet-foot">
            <span class="t-like"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21s-7.5-4.9-9.8-9.2C.6 8.6 2.6 5 6 5c2 0 3.4 1.1 4 2.2C10.6 6.1 12 5 14 5c3.4 0 5.4 3.6 3.8 6.8C19.5 16.1 12 21 12 21z"/></svg></span>
            <span class="t-reply">Reply</span>
            <span class="t-copy">Copy link</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="tweet">
          <div class="tweet-head">
            <img src="/assets/avatars/tw-Udhayya_.jpg" alt="Udhaya" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <div class="tweet-who"><strong>Udhaya</strong><span>@Udhayya_ · <a>Follow</a></span></div>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="x-logo"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="tweet-text">We had 4 agency proposals quoting 6 months. Deslopify shipped our full autonomous KYC workflow in 14 days.</p>
          <div class="tweet-foot">
            <span class="t-like"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21s-7.5-4.9-9.8-9.2C.6 8.6 2.6 5 6 5c2 0 3.4 1.1 4 2.2C10.6 6.1 12 5 14 5c3.4 0 5.4 3.6 3.8 6.8C19.5 16.1 12 21 12 21z"/></svg></span>
            <span class="t-reply">Reply</span>
            <span class="t-copy">Copy link</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="tweet">
          <div class="tweet-head">
            <img src="/assets/avatars/tw-FKThedesigner.jpg" alt="Faruk Yurtseven" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <div class="tweet-who"><strong>Faruk Yurtseven</strong><span>@FKThedesigner · <a>Follow</a></span></div>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="x-logo"><path d="M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="tweet-text">The attention to typography, micro-interactions, and AI integration is unmatched. Real engineering craft.</p>
          <div class="tweet-foot">
            <span class="t-like"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 21s-7.5-4.9-9.8-9.2C.6 8.6 2.6 5 6 5c2 0 3.4 1.1 4 2.2C10.6 6.1 12 5 14 5c3.4 0 5.4 3.6 3.8 6.8C19.5 16.1 12 21 12 21z"/></svg></span>
            <span class="t-reply">Reply</span>
            <span class="t-copy">Copy link</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Cal booking frame -->
  <div class="cal-frame" id="book" style="margin-top: 60px;">
    <div class="cal-mid">
      <div class="cal-inner" style="background:#ffffff; border-radius:24px; padding:36px; text-align:center; border:1px solid #e2e4ef; box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
        <h3 style="font-family:var(--jakarta); font-size:26px; font-weight:800; color:var(--ink-heading); margin-bottom:8px;">Ready to Deslopify Your Application?</h3>
        <p style="font-size:15px; color:var(--gray); max-width:540px; margin:0 auto 24px;">Book a direct 20-minute architecture review with our principal team. Send screenshots in advance and we will review them live.</p>
        <div style="display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:16px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a class="submit-btn-primary" href="/contact-us" style="max-width:280px;">
            Schedule Sprint Review
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7" />
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a class="filter-btn" href="/pricing" style="padding:14px 24px; font-size:15px; border-radius:12px;">
            View Detailed Plans & Deliverables
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
